These functions participate in design-aware preprocessing, resampling, bootstrap, feature engineering, supervised/probabilistic modeling, calibration, imbalance handling, explanation, diagnostics, and reporting. Managed operations preserve the package's training/assessment boundaries. Runtime and numerical certification for the complete staged release remains deferred to the consolidated local validation campaign.
}
